  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还不够！还不够啊！\n我需要更强的火力啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD84E0D591FFF018FD84E0D591F554AFF01000A62119700898166F45F3A7684706B529B554AFF01FF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你听到我火热的自言自语了吧？\n虽然声音已经大得不能算是自言自语了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60542C52306211706B70ED768481EA8A0081EA8BED4E865427FF1F000A867D713658F097F35DF27ECF59275F974E0D80FD7B97662F81EA8A0081EA8BED4E863002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实是因为\n我们厨房的火力不足。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n负责火力的小狮狮，\n不对战就一点都燃不起来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E662F56E04E3A000A62114EEC53A8623F7684706B529B4E0D8DB3300200100001BE01000A8D1F8D23706B529B76845C0F72EE72EEFF0C000A4E0D5BF962185C314E0070B990FD71C34E0D8D7767653002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以就拜托你了！\n为了让我的小狮狮燃起炙热的火焰，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n请和我来场火花四溅的宝可梦对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C3162DC62584F604E86FF01000A4E3A4E868BA9621176845C0F72EE72EE71C38D77709970ED7684706B7130FF0C00100001BE00000A8BF7548C62116765573A706B82B156DB6E8576845B9D53EF68A65BF9621854273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是能打火花四溅的宝可梦对战，\n就来跟我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F80FD6253706B82B156DB6E8576845B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427FF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了让我的小狮狮燃起炙热的火焰，\n请和我来场火花四溅的宝可梦对战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BA9621176845C0F72EE72EE71C38D77709970ED7684706B7130FF0C000A8BF7548C62116765573A706B82B156DB6E8576845B9D53EF68A65BF9621854273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "燃起来！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71C38D776765FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太冷淡了。\n这样下去客人也会失望的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A51B76DE14E863002000A8FD968374E0B53BB5BA24EBA4E5F4F1A5931671B76843002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你来场仿佛要被\n火属性招式灼伤般的炙热对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584F606765573A4EFF4F5B898188AB000A706B5C5E602762DB5F0F707C4F24822C7684709970ED5BF962185427FF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这场对战让我这个训练家\n都快要燃烧起来了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9573A5BF962188BA962118FD94E2A8BAD7EC35BB6000A90FD5FEB898171C370E78D7767654E863002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说小狮狮啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n打了这么酣畅淋漓的对战，\n你也能拿出真本事点火了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF45C0F72EE72EE554A300200100001BE01000A62534E868FD94E48916375456DCB6F1376845BF96218FF0C000A4F604E5F80FD62FF51FA771F672C4E8B70B9706B4E865427FF1F001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噶噶呜！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56765676545CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这才对嘛，小狮狮！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要想拿出真本事烤肉排，\n就得全力以赴才行！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9624D5BF9561BFF0C5C0F72EE72EEFF0100100001BE01000A898160F362FF51FA771F672C4E8B70E480896392FF0C000A5C315F975168529B4EE58D74624D884CFF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你！这个就送给你了。\n请给灼伤的宝可梦用吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF018FD94E2A5C3190017ED94F604E863002000A8BF77ED9707C4F2476845B9D53EF68A6752854273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小狮狮！回厨房咯。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n今天的客人可真是幸运！\n他们能吃到用最棒的火力烤出来的肉排！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
